---
layout: base.njk
---
<section class="hero">
  <p class="eyebrow">{{ site.role }}</p>
  <h1>I design and build calm, useful software.</h1>
  <p class="lede">
    I'm {{ site.name }}. I work with small teams on product design and front-end
    — from the first sketch to the release that ships. Currently taking on
    projects for later this year.
  </p>
  <p class="actions">
    <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/projects/">See the work</a>
    <a class="btn" href="/contact/">Get in touch</a>
  </p>
</section>

<section aria-labelledby="selected">
  <div class="section-head">
    <h2 id="selected">Selected work</h2>
    <a href="/projects/">All projects &rarr;</a>
  </div>
  <ul class="grid">
    {%- for p in collections.projects %}{% if p.data.featured %}
    {% include "card.njk" %}
    {%- endif %}{% endfor %}
  </ul>
</section>

{# Template note — delete this whole <aside> once the site is yours. #}
<aside class="template-note">
  <p>
    <strong>This site is a template.</strong> Jane is a placeholder: swap in your
    name, your projects and your words, push, and it deploys itself to a URL of
    your own.
  </p>
  <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://github.com/one9x/template-eleventy-portfolio/generate">Use this template &rarr;</a>
</aside>
